# ==============================================================================
# PORTFOLIO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==============================================================================
# For Cloudflare Pages deployment:
# Add these same environment variables in your Cloudflare Pages dashboard under:
# Settings -> Environment Variables.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Web3Forms Access Key (for Contact Form direct email delivery)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your free key in 30 seconds at: https://web3forms.com
# Enter your email: aniketmeshram445@gmail.com
# Paste the access key received below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Supabase Configuration (for globally synced notes on The Wall)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a free project at: https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL script from "supabase_schema.sql" in the Supabase SQL Editor
# 3. Go to Project Settings -> API, and copy Project URL and anon public key:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
